@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
title Proposed verified identity and current operation authority
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Caller
participant "Entry / session mechanism" as E
participant "Identity contract" as I
participant "Resource owner" as O
database "Current resource / grant / version state" as D
Caller -> E : protected request + credential/session context
E -> I : verify actual account/session eligibility
I --> E : verified context or no valid context
alt valid attributable context
 E -> O : intended resource/action + validated input
 O -> I : current scoped operation authority
 I --> O : current policy context or denial
 O -> D : evaluate resource lifecycle / version under guard
 D --> O : actual current state
 alt permitted guarded operation
  O --> Caller : bounded result / exact controlled delivery context
 else denied / stale / invalid
  O --> Caller : safe refusal / conflict; no private disclosure
 end
else absent / invalid context
 E --> Caller : safe authentication / eligibility response
end
note over I,D
 Long-lived workers and native Git paths need equivalent owner checks, not a reused browser session.
 Raw credentials never enter ordinary diagnostics; current revocation ordering needs concrete synchronization.
end note
@enduml
